Chapter: NotificationLogSeverityTest
  cites Observe chapter NotificationLog
  cites Observe chapter Journal
  cites Dev chapter Notification
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 Every notification severity maps to one journal level. Critical is the line
 that matters: the chapter matched a constructor that does not exist there and
 compiled nowhere, because nothing cited it.

Section: Body

  nls-level : LogLevel -> Text
  nls-level (l) = when l
    is LogDebug -> "debug"
    is LogInfo -> "info"
    is LogWarn -> "warn"
    is LogError -> "error"
    is LogFatal -> "fatal"

  nls-row : NotifSeverity -> Text
  nls-row (s) = notif-severity-label s & " -> " & nls-level (nl-severity-to-log-level s)

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (nls-row SevInfo)
    print-line-uni (nls-row SevSuccess)
    print-line-uni (nls-row SevWarning)
    print-line-uni (nls-row SevError)
    print-line-uni (nls-row SevCritical)
  end